{
  "id": "chromecast_mirror",
  "title": "Espelhamento: Chromecast Antigo",
  "parent": "dong_chromecast",
  "description": "Tutorial de espelhamento para Android usando o VLC Player como ponte para o Chromecast.",
  "content": {
    "type": "text",
    "data": "<div class='max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12 animate-fadeIn'><div class='bg-blue-600/10 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-6 rounded-r-2xl mb-8'><p class='text-blue-400 font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2'><i class='fab fa-chromecast'></i> Método VLC Mirror</p><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1 leading-relaxed'>Solução para modelos sem sistema próprio. Usamos o VLC Player no celular para transmitir o sinal para sua TV.</p></div><section class='relative pl-14'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-10 h-10 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>1</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-2'>Instale o Aplicativo Oficial</h4><div class='flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 justify-center md:justify-start'><a href='https://loja.toptv.app/apk/tppro.apk' class='w-full md:w-64 bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 p-5 rounded-3xl flex items-center gap-4 hover:border-blue-500 hover:bg-[#252b36] transition-all group shadow-xl'><img src='/shared_assets/logo/logo-tppro.webp' class='w-12 h-12 rounded-xl'><div class='flex-grow'><p class='text-xs font-black text-white uppercase'>TP PRO</p><p class='text-[9px] text-gray-500'>Oficial</p></div><i class='fas fa-download text-gray-700 group-hover:text-blue-500 transition-colors'></i></a></div></section><section class='relative pl-14'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-10 h-10 bg-orange-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg shadow-orange-900/40'>2</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-2'>Instale o Complemento Obrigatório</h4><p class='text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-8 italic'>Este app é a 'ponte' de transmissão para sua TV.</p><a href='https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=org.videolan.vlc' target='_blank' class='max-w-md bg-orange-600/10 border border-orange-500/30 p-6 rounded-[2rem] flex items-center gap-6 hover:bg-orange-600/20 transition-all group shadow-2xl'><div class='w-16 h-16 bg-white rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center p-2 shrink-0 shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform'><img src='/shared_assets/logo/logo-vlc.png' class='w-full h-full object-contain'></div><div class='flex-grow'><h4 class='text-white font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-lg'>VLC Player</h4><p class='text-[10px] text-orange-400 font-black uppercase tracking-widest'>Clique para baixar na Play Store</p></div><i class='fab fa-google-play text-2xl text-orange-500 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity'></i></a></section><section class='relative pl-14'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-10 h-10 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>3</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Configuração Final</h4><p class='text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8'>Abra seu app de IPTV, vá em <b>Configurações</b> > <b>'Player Externo'</b> e escolha o <b>VLC Player</b>.</p><div class='bg-emerald-600/10 border border-emerald-500/20 p-6 rounded-[2rem] flex items-center gap-6 shadow-xl'><div class='w-14 h-14 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shrink-0 shadow-lg animate-pulse'><i class='fas fa-check'></i></div><div class='flex-grow'><h4 class='text-white font-black uppercase text-sm tracking-widest'>Pronto para assistir!</h4><p class='text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed'>Agora basta clicar em qualquer canal e a opção de transmissão aparecerá no topo do vídeo.</p></div></div></section></div>"
  }
}
